          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "31f4f01f-c8a8-4548-8071-f8da5df72c0d",
                "quote": "五個人會死是電車造成的，不是我。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 16
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9f0e69a4-2003-4670-8bda-dc8314369844",
                "quote": "人不能被拿來當成救別人的工具。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "83f5e286-43fe-4b10-8f86-3ad7766979f4",
                "quote": "不管救幾個人，殺一個無辜的人就是錯的，這條線不能跨。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 26
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "adc20cfc-054b-45c5-8ab6-158eeb7f04bb",
        "display_name": "張家豪",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9d664098-410f-45ca-8acc-7832c5e15bad",
                "quote": "電車轉過去，那個人死是副作用，不是我想要他死。",
                "start": 3,
                "end": 26
              },
              {
                "message_id": "203aeec9-eb64-4c92-95a9-0d584fc44ab1",
                "quote": "他的死就是手段。",
                "start": 18,
                "end": 26
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9d664098-410f-45ca-8acc-7832c5e15bad",
                "quote": "會拉",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "07b1b8c0-c37e-427e-962c-86faea508fa4",
                "quote": "我的目的是救五個人，不是殺那一個。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 17
              },
              {
                "message_id": "203aeec9-eb64-4c92-95a9-0d584fc44ab1",
                "quote": "他的死就是手段。",
                "start": 18,
                "end": 26
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "15f213ef-7f2c-4802-875d-529e96f01b6e",
                "quote": "拉桿的時候如果那個人剛好跑掉，我也很高興",
                "start": 7,
                "end": 27
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 4.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "15f213ef-7f2c-4802-875d-529e96f01b6e",
                "quote": "跟拉桿不一樣",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 6
              },
              {
                "message_id": "203aeec9-eb64-4c92-95a9-0d584fc44ab1",
                "quote": "這次那個人是被我拿來擋車的",
                "start": 4,
                "end": 17
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
